CATEGORIES:TOHO
DESCRIPTION:War reduced Japan to zero\, and Godzilla plunged it into minus
 . Two years have passed since then\, and the country has faced agonizing 
 struggles to achieve recovery and finally reclaim its daily life. Just as
  humanity managed to cling to a hard-won peace\, a new threat strikes\, c
 rushing hope in an instant. There is no third time. Everything ends here.
