BEGIN:VEVENT
CATEGORIES:Mobra Films
DESCRIPTION:Following the deaths of Mihai's parents\, Mihai and Lisbet Ghe
 orghiu leave their life behind in Romania and move with their children to
  a remote village in Norway\, hoping to rebuild their lives near Lisbet's
  family. There\, they grow close to their neighbors\, the Halbergs\, whos
 e warmth gives them hope for a fresh start. But the fragile peace begins 
 to unravel when the Gheorghiu family’s young daughter\, Elia\, arrives at
  school covered in bruises.
